  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Food Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this 12-month program which will target 6,249 vulnerable households or approximately 28,746 individuals is to improve the immediate and longer-term access and availability of food for vulnerable and food insecure households, including smallholders, in the target areas.</narrative>
  </description>
